  <h3>hexadecimals</h3>
  <p>
    it counts till 15 starting at 0 so 6 values. so it's 16 times 16 for max
  </p>
  <h3>@media and @supports</h3>
  <p>
    @media is to check device capability and @supports is for browser support
  </p>
  <h3>using unsupported gamut</h3>
  <p>
    if you use display-p3 or rec2020 and its not supported it will get the
    closest color going straight to white.
  </p>
  <h3>okhcl is best</h3>
  <p>
    use for gradients and not for straight colors because it would make colors
    outside the gamut a display can show
  </p>
